ots 1
# journey-arcade-1p: 1 Player Arcade, episode 1, Normal; play level 1.
# Authored against ot-ref-run (virtual clock); the title menu is ready at ~8.1 s.
# title: Start New Game
@8500 key-down RETURN
@8560 key-up RETURN
# Players: 1 Player Arcade
@10300 key-down DOWN
@10360 key-up DOWN
@10600 key-down RETURN
@10660 key-up RETURN
# Episode 1: Escape
@12400 key-down RETURN
@12460 key-up RETURN
# Difficulty: Normal
@14200 key-down RETURN
@14260 key-up RETURN
# arcade Game Menu: Play Next Level
@19500 key-down RETURN
@19560 key-up RETURN
# arcade level 1: fire and strafe (picks up the Sonic Wave and the Vulcan Cannon)
@22500 key-down SPACE
@22500 key-down LEFT
@23500 key-up LEFT
@24800 key-down RIGHT
@26800 key-up RIGHT
@28100 key-down UP
@28600 key-up UP
@32900 key-down LEFT
@34400 key-up LEFT
@34700 key-up SPACE
